**{{month_year}}:** Lab-grown marquise prices continue to compress. 1ct D VVS2 lab IGI at $657 and 1ct D VVS1 lab IGI at $958 represent current market lows — down significantly from two years ago. Natural 1ct marquise H-I VS2 has held steady at $4,049–$4,393. The gap between natural and lab at 1ct is now 84–86%. At 2ct, natural starts at $22,421; lab D VVS1 starts at $2,403. The Carat Jump has never been larger.

